        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngensuku zokubusa kukaJehoyakimi uNebukadineza inkosi yaseBabiloni wahlasela, uJehoyakimi wathela kuye; kodwa ngemva kweminyaka emithathu wamvukela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.25.1+JER.25.2+JER.25.3+JER.25.4+JER.25.5+JER.25.6+JER.25.7+JER.25.8+JER.25.9+JER.25.10+JER.25.11+JER.25.12+JER.25.13+JER.25.14+JER.25.15+JER.25.16+JER.25.17+JER.25.18+JER.25.19+JER.25.20+JER.25.21+JER.25.22+JER.25.23+JER.25.24+JER.25.25+JER.25.26+JER.25.27+JER.25.28+JER.25.29+JER.25.30+JER.25.31+JER.25.32+JER.25.33+JER.25.34+JER.25.35+JER.25.36+JER.25.37+JER.25.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 25:1–38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.1.1+DAN.1.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 1:1–2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu yamthumela izimpana zamaKaladiya lezamaSiriya lezamaMowabi lezamaAmoni, zahlasela koJuda ukuba zimchithe, njengelizwi leNkosi eyalikhuluma ngenceku zayo abaprofethi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konke lokho kwenzeka koJuda ukuba kugcwaliseke ilizwi leNkosi ukubasusa phambi kwayo ngenxa yazo zonke izono zikaManase azenzayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "langenxa yegazi elingelacala alichithayo: wagcwalisa iJerusalema ngegazi elingelacala, iNkosi yayingamthetheleli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezinye indaba zikaJehoyakimi lakho konke akwenzayo kulotshiwe ogwalweni lwezindaba zamakhosi akoJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoyakimi waya kwabaphansi. UJehoyakini indodana yakhe waba yinkosi esikhundleni sakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi yaseGibithe kayiphindanga ukuphuma elizweni layo ngoba inkosi yaseBabiloni yayisithumbe zonke indawo zenkosi yaseGibithe kusukela emfuleni waseGibithe kusiya emfuleni iYufrathi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoyakini waba yinkosi eseleminyaka elitshumi lesificaminwembili lapho eqala ukubusa; wabusa inyanga ezintathu eJerusalema. Ibizo likanina lalinguNehushita indodakazi kaElinathani waseJerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wenza okubi phambi kweNkosi njengokwenza konke kukayise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalesosikhathi amabutho kaNebukadineza inkosi yaseBabiloni afika eJerusalema, awuvimbezela umuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNebukadineza inkosi yaseBabiloni wafika emzini, amabutho akhe esawuvimbezele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehoyakini inkosi yakoJuda wazinikela enkosini yaseBabiloni yena lonina lezinceku zakhe lezinduna zakhe labathenwa bakhe. Inkosi yaseBabiloni yamthumba ngomnyaka wesificaminwembili wokubusa kwakhe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.22.24+JER.22.25+JER.22.26+JER.22.27+JER.22.28+JER.22.29+JER.22.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 22:24–30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.24.1+JER.24.2+JER.24.3+JER.24.4+JER.24.5+JER.24.6+JER.24.7+JER.24.8+JER.24.9+JER.24.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
