              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UZedekiya waba yinkosi eseleminyaka engamatshumi amabili lanye lapho eqalisa ukubusa; wabusa iminyaka elitshumi lanye eJerusalema. Ibizo likanina lalinguHamubali indodakazi kaJeremiya waseLibina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
